#[section, $md:
    @../../ (Documentation) / @../ (Packages and imports) / Builder packages

    # Builder packages

    Builder packages are selected by the project builder. The HTML builder
    provides `@html` as a source-backed compile-time helper package and
    `@web/canvas` as a binding-backed runtime drawing package.

    Both ship as early skeletons and will grow as the language stabilises and
    the standard library expands. The @../../progress (progress matrix) owns
    current support status.

    ## Package pages

    - @html/ (@html)
    - @canvas/ (@web/canvas)
]

